{
  "baseUrl": "http://localhost:8080",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "fps": 30,
  "cursor": {
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 760,
    "visible": false
  },
  "voice": {
    "preferNames": [
      "Jessica",
      "Laura",
      "Sarah",
      "Aria",
      "Lily"
    ],
    "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "stability": 0.42,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.04
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "type": "goto",
      "url": "/video/intro.html"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "text": "Meet FloorCheck: the AI floor-plan auditor for equipment lenders.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "url": "/video/intro.html"
        },
        {
          "type": "cursor",
          "visible": false
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "text": "When a dealer sells a tractor the lender paid for, and keeps the money, that's called sold out of trust. It's the classic floor-plan loss. And lenders usually find out weeks later, from an auditor walking the lot with a clipboard.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "url": "/dealers/valley-ag/"
        },
        {
          "type": "scrollTo",
          "selector": "#unit-KBM7172PRE5531086",
          "block": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "cursor",
          "visible": true,
          "x": 1500,
          "y": 820
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#unit-KBM7172PRE5531086",
          "atMs": 2600,
          "moveMs": 1100
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "book",
      "text": "Here's a lender's floor-plan book: forty-two tractors and farm machines across three dealers, four point six million dollars outstanding.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "url": "/?mode=replay&replay_ms=17000"
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#kpi-exposure",
          "atMs": 600,
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": ".dealer-card[data-dealer='ironline']",
          "atMs": 3600,
          "moveMs": 900
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "run",
      "text": "One click hands the audit to an always-on agent with its own computer on Agent37. It opens each dealer's inventory page in its own browser, reads every listing, and writes what it found to a file on its machine. This is a recording of a real run: forty seconds, ten tool calls.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#run-audit",
          "moveMs": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#timeline",
          "atMs": 4200,
          "moveMs": 1200,
          "offsetY": -120
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "results",
      "text": "FloorCheck pulls that file back and matches every financed serial number. Thirty-five units are verified on the lot. But three are listed as sold while the advance is still unpaid: two hundred sixty-two thousand dollars, sold out of trust. Plus three units that aren't listed anywhere.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#kpi-verified",
          "atMs": 3800,
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#kpi-soot",
          "atMs": 7600,
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#kpi-notfound",
          "atMs": 14500,
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "waitFor",
          "selector": "body[data-run-state='complete']",
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "text": "Every exception is defensible: the listing exactly as the dealer published it, the URL, a timestamp, and a field-by-field match against the ledger.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".finding[data-unit='FP-2041-019']",
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#drawer-body .cmp",
          "atMs": 5200,
          "moveMs": 900
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "recovery",
      "text": "And Monid pulls live market comps for that exact model, so the lender knows what it would actually recover: about forty-two thousand dollars, against a seventy-one thousand dollar advance.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scrollBy",
          "selector": "#drawer-body",
          "y": 560,
          "ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": ".recovery-figs",
          "atMs": 1600,
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": ".recovery .comps",
          "atMs": 6500,
          "moveMs": 900
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "coverage",
      "text": "For everything still on the lot, FloorCheck estimates what the collateral is worth today, so the lender sees coverage, not just existence.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#drawer-close",
          "moveMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "selector": "#kpi-coverage",
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#tab-ledger",
          "atMs": 3200,
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "scrollBy",
          "selector": ".table-wrap",
          "y": 380,
          "ms": 1600,
          "atMs": 4600
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "actions",
      "text": "It drafts a payoff demand to each dealer, and the memo for the credit committee.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#btn-demands",
          "moveMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "ms": 2600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#modal-close",
          "moveMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#btn-memo",
          "moveMs": 700
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 1600
    },
    {
      "id": "schedule",
      "text": "And it schedules itself on Agent37, to run every night at 2 AM.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#modal-close",
          "moveMs": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#tab-activity",
          "moveMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#btn-schedule",
          "moveMs": 900
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 1400
    },
    {
      "id": "stack",
      "text": "Under the hood: Agent37 runs the agent, its computer, and its nightly schedule. Monid finds and runs the market-data scrapers. And InstaCloud hosts the app, with its Postgres audit trail.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "url": "/video/outro.html?hide=openai"
        },
        {
          "type": "cursor",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "#badge-agent37",
          "atMs": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "#badge-monid",
          "atMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "#badge-instacloud",
          "atMs": 8800
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "text": "FloorCheck walks every lot, every night, in under a minute, instead of an auditor driving lot to lot.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "cursor",
          "visible": false
        }
      ],
      "padAfterMs": 2200
    }
  ]
}